{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setLanguage:","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setLanguage:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"setLanguage:","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setLanguage:","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setLanguage:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets custom application language for localized notifications."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setLanguage:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"language"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The language code (e.g., “en”, “de”, “fr”, “es”) or nil to reset to device language","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"language"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Override the device language for Pushwoosh to enable:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sending notifications in a specific language"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Language-based segmentation"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Supporting in-app language switching","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Must be a lowercase two-letter code according to ISO-639-1 standard."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Support in-app language selection:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class LanguageManager {","","    static let shared = LanguageManager()","","    var currentLanguage: String {","        didSet {","            applyLanguageChange()","        }","    }","","    func applyLanguageChange() {","        \/\/ Update Pushwoosh language for targeted notifications","        Pushwoosh.configure.setLanguage(currentLanguage)","","        \/\/ Update user tags","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"language\": currentLanguage,","            \"language_changed_date\": Date()","        ])","","        \/\/ Update app UI","        Bundle.setLanguage(currentLanguage)","        NotificationCenter.default.post(name: .languageDidChange, object: nil)","","        Logger.info(\"App language changed to: \\(currentLanguage)\")","    }","","    func resetToDeviceLanguage() {","        Pushwoosh.configure.setLanguage(nil)","        currentLanguage = Locale.current.languageCode ?? \"en\"","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“zh” (Chinese), “ja” (Japanese), “ko” (Korean), “ru” (Russian)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setlanguage:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setLanguage:":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setlanguage:","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setLanguage:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"setLanguage:","abstract":[{"text":"Sets custom application language for localized notifications.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setLanguage:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setLanguage:","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}